ce:'all' →\nambiguous (tak melebar diam-diam)\ntarget sudah punya revisi →\npre-existing-revisions (dilewati)\nreplace-all: satu kemunculan per\npanggilan, DARI BELAKANG", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "839028e3440e40aa85c7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1470, "y": 640, "width": 430, "height": 172.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["290c3bd2d9fa4d4791f9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 470039324, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 225071009, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "7a32a1657811454b9045", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "7dda4f1aa9dc4c9ca8c5", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b50aed60a9aa4c89b363", "type": "text", "x": 1484, "y": 654, "width": 201.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["290c3bd2d9fa4d4791f9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 202866481, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1598727514, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 · Tulis sebagai tracked", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 · Tulis sebagai tracked", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ec3cf71d515e4ea2b389", "type": "text", "x": 1484, "y": 684.5, "width": 260.2, "height": 113.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["290c3bd2d9fa4d4791f9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1523930448, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1116348811, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ganti = insertText(after) LALU delete(match)\n— BUKAN insertText(Replace) (Word Mac\nmemecahnya jadi hapus tak terlacak)\nhapus seluruh teks paragraf →\nhapus paragraf utuh (penomoran ulang)\nformat: font bold/italic/underline;\ngaya heading → paragraf", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ganti = insertText(after) LALU delete(match)\n— BUKAN insertText(Replace) (Word Mac\nmemecahnya jadi hapus tak terlacak)\nhapus seluruh teks paragraf →\nhapus paragraf utuh (penomoran ulang)\nformat: font bold/italic/underline;\ngaya heading → paragraf", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "91bddc8b05fe418f907f", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1940, "y": 640, "width": 430, "height": 172.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4bfad1c2b86d4bfc9ba8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1624093915, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1403020282, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "7dda4f1aa9dc4c9ca8c5", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4f59e7821c2f4439a6ec", "type": "text", "x": 1954, "y": 654, "width": 171.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4bfad1c2b86d4bfc9ba8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 169095779, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 109531205, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 · Tahan & verifikasi", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 · Tahan & verifikasi", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "2a632d0177794bac86d3", "type": "text", "x": 1954, "y": 684.5, "width": 221.9, "height": 113.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4bfad1c2b86d4bfc9ba8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 575419734, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 225083075, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "revisi yang BARU dibuat diambil dari\nrentang target (tepat revisi edit ini)\ndisaring terhadap saudara; bookmark\ntersembunyi = anchor tahan lama +\ncatat ID di daftar diterapkan\nbatch gagal tengah jalan → baca\nverifikasi; tak terbukti → 'tak pasti'", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "revisi yang BARU dibuat diambil dari\nrentang target (tepat revisi edit ini)\ndisaring terhadap saudara; bookmark\ntersembunyi = anchor tahan lama +\ncatat ID di daftar diterapkan\nbatch gagal tengah jalan → baca\nverifikasi; tak terbukti → 'tak pasti'", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d96c926a233e46b1afbc", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 900, "width": 1260, "height": 238.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["afb224f1bf054654ae0b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 628416591, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146757393, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "963eaddb953d4a9fac44", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 914, "width": 301.6, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["afb224f1bf054654ae0b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1618585364, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 880470841, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Terima / tolak (resolveTrackedEdit)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Terima / tolak (resolveTrackedEdit)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3e98d2d182a94e8c9a3c", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 945.8, "width": 569.5, "height": 178.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["afb224f1bf054654ae0b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 20262136, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1842839130, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TIDAK PERNAH acceptAll/rejectAll: hanya revisi persis milik edit ini\nurutan: (a) proxy revisi anak yang ditangkap saat apply → bila basi (edit lain di\n  paragraf sama): (b) anchor passage — baca revisi hidup, verifikasi per ISI;\n  sisi Added dan Deleted boleh lewat anchor berbeda (Word tak andal) → (c) terakhir:\n  semua revisi dokumen, dipilih menurut teks + relasi rentang\nDua tahap: tahap 1 hanya-baca (cari anchor tiap sisi; kurang satu = batal, dokumen utuh),\n  tahap 2 baru memutasi · tak ada revisi tersisa → 'Word melaporkan tak ada revisi lagi'\nsimpan: PATCH /word-chat/messages/:id/edits/:blockIndex {resolution_status accepted|rejected}\n  (DB: resolution hanya sah bila apply_status = 'applied')\npembersihan best-effort setelahnya (bookmark, entri settings, proxy): gagal tak mengubah\n  hasil dokumen; user dikabari SATU kalimat tentang yang tersisa", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TIDAK PERNAH acceptAll/rejectAll: hanya revisi persis milik edit ini\nurutan: (a) proxy revisi anak yang ditangkap saat apply → bila basi (edit lain di\n  paragraf sama): (b) anchor passage — baca revisi hidup, verifikasi per ISI;\n  sisi Added dan Deleted boleh lewat anchor berbeda (Word tak andal) → (c) terakhir:\n  semua revisi dokumen, dipilih menurut teks + relasi rentang\nDua tahap: tahap 1 hanya-baca (cari anchor tiap sisi; kurang satu = batal, dokumen utuh),\n  tahap 2 baru memutasi · tak ada revisi tersisa → 'Word melaporkan tak ada revisi lagi'\nsimpan: PATCH /word-chat/messages/:id/edits/:blockIndex {resolution_status accepted|rejected}\n  (DB: resolution hanya sah bila apply_status = 'applied')\npembersihan best-effort setelahnya (bookmark, entri settings, proxy): gagal tak mengubah\n  hasil dokumen; user dikabari SATU kalimat tentang yang tersisa", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "99082e0e6df142698174", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1360, "y": 900, "width": 640, "height": 238.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["113bf37874c14a9f809b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1505679738, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1015737222, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "3f293fd96a5542f8a866", "type": "text", "x": 1374, "y": 946.5, "width": 208.8, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["113bf37874c14a9f809b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 529513995, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 113476439, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Pane ditutup lalu dibuka", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Pane ditutup lalu dibuka", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d1fd185b68784cbbbdfb", "type": "text", "x": 1374, "y": 978.2, "width": 268.3, "height": 113.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["113bf37874c14a9f809b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1092582530, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 219694028, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "restoreTrackedEdits: kartu dipulihkan dari\n  baris tersimpan (cloud / IndexedDB) +\n  registri anchor di Office settings\nrevealPersistedTrackedEdit: 'View' ke\n  teks lewat bookmark\nSave As: identitas dokumen baru (URL beda)\n  → registri anchor lama DIBUANG", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "restoreTrackedEdits: kartu dipulihkan dari\n  baris tersimpan (cloud / IndexedDB) +\n  registri anchor di Office settings\nrevealPersistedTrackedEdit: 'View' ke\n  teks lewat bookmark\nSave As: identitas dokumen baru (URL beda)\n  → registri anchor lama DIBUANG", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "c7cdff89226b49d68a01", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2040, "y": 900, "width": 640, "height": 238.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6354ade6b68740e89017"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1384263048, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1458222335, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "99a4a36a07524063b014", "type": "text", "x": 2054, "y": 954.6, "width": 328.4, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6354ade6b68740e89017"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 79536460, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1384229677, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Penjaga di backend (wordClientTools)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Penjaga di backend (wordClientTools)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4e74426aaecf4eff8eb2", "type": "text", "x": 2054, "y": 986.4, "width": 320.2, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["6354ade6b68740e89017"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1609121884, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 687826234, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178308, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "maks 50 edit/panggilan; batch dicek semua-atau-tidak\n  (pane juga menolak batch tak valid utuh)\ndeadline apply 30 dtk + 3 dtk/edit (maks 180 dtk)\nedit & original_text >200 karakter ditolak sebelum\n  dikirim — agar tak ada edit yang bisa diterapkan\n  tapi tak bisa disimpan", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "maks 50 edit/panggilan; batch dicek semua-atau-tidak\n  (pane juga menolak batch tak valid utuh)\ndeadline apply 30 dtk + 3 dtk/edit (maks 180 dtk)\nedit & original_text >200 karakter ditolak sebelum\n  dikirim — agar tak ada edit yang bisa diterapkan\n  tapi tak bisa disimpan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "878aff8e1bef46809e24", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 20, "width": 1115.1, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "so